  "profile": {
    "name": "Nik Rakar",
    "role": "Photographer & cinematographer",
    "location": "Ljubljana, Slovenia",
    "headline": "Hi, I'm Nik.",
    "photo": "/photos/about/nik.jpg",
    "about": "Student photographer and cinematographer from Ljubljana, Slovenia, shooting portraits, cars, street and sport on photo and video.\n\nI've been shooting for 4 years. I started with a Canon 70D, carried it everywhere, and haven't stopped since. Today I work with a Sony A7 III. Some days that means a quiet portrait, others a car at golden hour or a fast moment on the field. In every shoot I look for the frame that feels real: clean light, strong composition and a bit of character.\n\nSo far I've mostly worked with small brands, helping them look as good online as they are in real life. I can take a project from planning the shots and filming on the gimbal to editing the final cut, so you get photos and video that match.\n\nIf you need portraits, content for your car or brand, or someone to film your event, send me a message. I'm always up for new ideas.",
    "years": "4 years",
    "gear": "Sony A7 III",
    "email": "rakarnik.studio@gmail.com",
    "instagram": "nik_rakar",
    "available": true
  },
